  = note: an absent `type`, `scxml`, or `http://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/` invokes an SCXML session; any other type names an invoked service by an exact absolute URI (a scheme, `:`, no white space, at most 4096 bytes), which the host binds to a service component
  = help: write the service's absolute type URI exactly as its service package declares it (`service-uri`), or `scxml` for an SCXML session
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>

warning[SCXML094]: no service package binds this `<invoke type>`
 --> tests/ui/invoke-service-types.scxml:4:19
  |
4 |     <invoke type="https://stateforward.org/scxml/services/echo" id="svc"/>
  |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ no service component is bound to this URI
  |
  = note: an invoked service runs only in the service component its host binds to the exact type URI; without one the session start fails closed, and `compile` rejects the document (`COMP004`)
  = help: bind the service with its package manifest (`--service-package MANIFEST.json`), or correct the URI to one a bound package declares
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>

